384
00:28:01,560 --> 00:28:02,200
Miss.

385
00:28:03,200 --> 00:28:03,980
Adler.

386
00:28:04,380 --> 00:28:05,160
Adler.

387
00:28:06,080 --> 00:28:07,420
Sadie Adler.

388
00:28:07,860 --> 00:28:15,320
Mrs. I... He... He was my husband.

389
00:28:20,740 --> 00:28:23,480
Dude, I can tell this is gonna be really good.

390
00:28:27,260 --> 00:28:29,580
Look at that shot, holy shit.

391
00:28:31,580 --> 00:28:32,040
Wow.

392
00:28:33,520 --> 00:28:35,480
How the hell is this game eight years old?

393
