Tom O'Driscoll and his scum, they beat us to it.

394
00:28:55,330 --> 00:28:59,850
We found some of them there, but there is more about.

395
00:29:02,740 --> 00:29:03,860
Scouting the train.

396
00:29:04,240 --> 00:29:05,040
Thank you.

397
00:29:05,480 --> 00:29:07,520
That's the last thing we need right now, Dutch.

398
00:29:07,780 --> 00:29:08,960
