399
00:29:09,180 --> 00:29:13,340
But we found some supplies, some blankets, a little bit of food.

400
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:19,420
And this poor soul, Mrs. Adler... Miss Tilly, Miss Karen, would you warm her up?

401
00:29:19,740 --> 00:29:20,840
Give her a drink or something?

402
00:29:21,900 --> 00:29:24,800
And Mrs. Adler, it's gonna be okay.

403
00:29:25,260 --> 00:29:26,340
You're safe now.

404
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:29,220
They turned her into a widow.

405
00:29:29,900 --> 00:29:30,380
Animals.

406
00:29:52,030 --> 00:29:53,250
Ooh!

407
00:29:53,250 --> 00:29:54,470
Bill!

408
00:29:54,890 --> 00:29:56,310
Bill Williamson!

409
00:29:56,810 --> 00:29:58,410
No shit.

