469
00:34:12,940 --> 00:34:15,200
Damn snow's coming in hard again.

470
00:34:15,780 --> 00:34:17,800
We'll lose these tracks if we don't move fast.

471
00:34:23,350 --> 00:34:26,770
Dude, this is like a movie.

472
00:34:28,810 --> 00:34:29,910
Holy shit.

473
00:34:41,030 --> 00:34:42,690
This music is fantastic.

474
