Watch yourself, it's not very wide here.

475
00:34:51,970 --> 00:34:53,150
Oh shit, yeah.

476
00:34:53,530 --> 00:34:54,650
Whoa, careful, careful.

477
00:34:56,110 --> 00:34:56,910
Horses scared.

478
00:35:15,380 --> 00:35:16,820
I mean, we know he's gonna be alright.

479
00:35:17,100 --> 00:35:18,180
You know, cause it's a prequel.

480
00:35:28,680 --> 00:35:29,200
Oh yeah.

481
00:35:47,730 --> 00:35:48,870
Oh shit.

482
00:35:54,550 --> 00:35:55,490
Let's go.

483
00:35:57,430 --> 00:35:58,790
Oh man, look at that.

484
00:35:59,430 --> 00:36:00,690
That's gruesome.

485
00:36:21,180 --> 00:36:23,860
Okay, you can only carry one sidearm at a time.

486
00:36:24,120 --> 00:36:26,780
You can swap your carried weapons with weapons stored on your horse.

487
00:36:36,480 --> 00:36:44,360
Dude, I feel the GTA 6 where they got the inspiration from here for some of this stuff.

488
00:36:48,060 --> 00:36:49,100
This is excellent.

489
00:37:05,910 --> 00:37:07,390
Man, you don't want to slip here.

490
00:37:07,490 --> 00:37:08,210
Holy crap.

491
00:37:13,610 --> 00:37:16,710
Dude, this guy seems nothing like the Javier from the first game.

492
00:37:17,490 --> 00:37:21,010
But then again, we didn't really see him for that long.

493
00:37:26,570 --> 00:37:27,090
Okay.

494
00:37:29,150 --> 00:37:29,670
Whoa.

495
00:37:32,170 --> 00:37:32,990
I'm careful.

496
