498
00:37:59,870 --> 00:38:00,850
Stamina core.

499
00:38:02,270 --> 00:38:03,510
Canned kidney beans?

500
00:38:26,060 --> 00:38:27,880
Oh, get up there!

501
00:38:28,200 --> 00:38:28,520
Careful!

502
00:38:34,820 --> 00:38:36,100
Oh, come on!

503
00:38:36,360 --> 00:38:37,160
There we go.

504
00:38:48,700 --> 00:38:53,720
The game runs really well, too.

505
00:39:12,350 --> 00:39:13,790
Oh my god, we're gonna see him!

506
00:39:14,030 --> 00:39:15,230
This is gonna be so weird.

507
00:39:23,070 --> 00:39:24,750
Yeah, there we go.

508
00:39:39,460 --> 00:39:40,880
It's good to hear his voice again.

509
