514
00:40:18,560 --> 00:40:18,920
See?

515
00:40:19,420 --> 00:40:22,380
I told Dutch you weren't the right man for this.

516
00:40:31,140 --> 00:40:33,300
Dude, that was an excellent shot.

517
00:40:34,120 --> 00:40:34,580
Wow.

518
00:40:36,620 --> 00:40:37,700
